IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-TRT-PAGED-KV.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-SEQS            PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOTAL-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BLOCK-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ACTIVE-BLOCKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-TRT-PAGED-KV.
    IF BLOCK-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE TOTAL-TOKENS TO ACTIVE-BLOCKS.
    DIVIDE BLOCK-SIZE INTO ACTIVE-BLOCKS.
    IF ACTIVE-BLOCKS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO ACTIVE-BLOCKS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 ACTIVE-BLOCKS.
    WEIGHT 30 NUM-SEQS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
